# What the toolchain image (tools/Dockerfile) is built from: the
# compiler's crates, the standard library, the examples, the reference.
# Everything else stays out — the build output above all, which is
# gigabytes.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!lib
!examples
!tools/dist.sh
!tools/Dockerfile
!LANGUAGE.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
crates/**/target
